{
    "title": "DK Horse Racing & Betting",
    "description": "\ud83c\udfc7 <b> Legally bet on hundreds of horse race tracks, worldwide! </b> \ud83c\udfc7 \r\n\r\nBetting on horses online has never been easier or more fun. Whether you're a seasoned punter or trying your hand at horse racing betting for the first time, DK Horse makes the experience effortless and exhilarating. Add to the thrill by placing a wager on your picks, and cheer them on to victory! \ud83c\udfc6\r\n\r\nSaddle up and wager at racing at hundreds of tracks from all around the world, including America's biggest racing events. Bet on the Kentucky Derby, Preakness Stakes, Belmont Stakes (the Triple Crown), the Breeders Cup, and more! Stream live horse races, and watch instant racing replays. \ud83c\udfa5\r\n\r\nGrab the reins, hold on tight, and pick your bets with DK Horse. \ud83d\udc0e\r\n\r\nGetting started and placing your first bet is quick and easy:\r\n\r\n1. Download the app & create a free account\r\n2. Pick a race, analyze real-time odds, and place your first bet\r\n3. Watch and Wager \u2013 any race you bet on, you can watch live!\r\n\r\n<b>The DK Horse racing & betting app is 100% FREE to download</b>, offering an unparalleled gateway to wager on races from hundreds of tracks worldwide.\r\n\r\nExplore our features:\r\n\r\n- Live Racing Access: Stream horse races live as they happen. Immerse yourself in the thrill of the race from anywhere!\r\n- Real-Time Live Odds: Stay informed with up-to-the-minute odds for win, ensuring you have all the data you need to make smart betting decisions.\r\n- Instant Replays: Missed a race? Watch instant replays at your convenience to catch up on all the action you missed.\r\n- Easy Start: Quick setup and user-friendly interface make placing your first bet a breeze, whether you\u2019re a seasoned bettor or new to the game.\r\n\r\nDownload the DK Horse app now if you love horse racing betting online & want to bring the experience of the racetrack to the palm of your hand!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc0e DK Horse is available ONLY to residents of CA, CO, FL, IL, IN, IA, KY, LA, MD, MA, MN, MT, NY, OH, OR, PA, VA, WA, WV and WY. \ud83d\udc0e\r\n\r\nThis is a real-money gambling app. Please gamble responsibly and only bet what you can afford. For gambling addiction help and support, please call 1-800-GAMBLER / 1-800-522-4700, or visit https://www.ncpgambling.org. 18+ (21+ in certain states) to open, own, or access an advance deposit wagering account and resident of a state where DK Horse is available. Eligibility restrictions apply. Void where prohibited. See terms at dkhorse.com.\r\n\r\nNew customer offer: 1 per new customer. Min. $25 deposit. Potential bonus amount is 100% of first deposit, up to $250. Deposit must be played-thru twice (2x) and bonus released in $25 increments, issued as withdrawable cash (e.g., $250 deposited, $50 wagered, $25 bonus released). Wagers must settle within 7 days (168 hours) following registration. Excludes Show wagers.\r\n\r\nTo learn more about current promotions and associated terms, see dkhorse.com\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc0e Privacy Policy: https://www.dkhorse.com/privacy-policy",
